  [https:\/\/www.youtube.com/watch?v=kasGRkfkiPM],
  [Bob Ross - Final Reflections (Season 1 Episode 13)],
  [A "must see" episode because it's actually Q&A of what might go wrong.],
  [https:\/\/www.youtube.com/watch?v=IEQWfszfRlA],
),
